### Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks

### Get task by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/1

### Create a task
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Task 1",
  "description": "Refactoring",
  "completed": false
}

### Update task
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Task 1",
  "description": "task one description",
  "completed": true
}

### Delete task
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/1

### Get completed tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/completed/true


### Get incomplete tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/completed/false


### Search tasks by title
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/search?title=poop